  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "租稅救濟與訴訟案例研討",
    "sub_ename": "STUDY ON TAX ADMINISTRATIVE REMEDY AND TAX LITIGATION CASES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程探討行政救濟制度及訴訟案例，結合會計、租稅及法律及國際租稅領域，訓練學生了解租稅實務，培養邏輯思考、分析及解決問題能力，可運用在個人與企業會計、財務與稅務管理，並保護納稅者權利。",
    "describe_eh": "This course investigates the administrative remedy of taxation system and lawsuit practical cases, which combines accounting, tax, law and international taxation. It can help students to understand taxation practice, and foster logical thinking, analyzing, and solving problem ability. These skills can apply to accounting, finance, tax management, and taxpayer rights protection.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
